# Sweep 2b · step 5 re-proof (verifier 4, 3fa049b3) — a click inside a sheet never moves the keys out of the sheet's field.
# Settings sheet › Web search › the Brave key field (SecureField, nothing typed), then real clicks elsewhere in the sheet
# (its label, the sheet's header blank), then Esc. Run with run.sh, EXTRA="-Sweep4Log YES". grade: grade5.py sheet <dir>
open-wait      wait 6000
sheet-open     click sidebar.settings
rest           wait 2500
sheet-row      click settingsRow.Web*
rest           wait 2000
s0             ax settings.webSearchSwitch AXRole
s-field        click placeholder:BSA...
rest           wait 1200
s1f            focus
s-label        click placeholder:BSA...@30,-14
rest           wait 1200
s2f            focus
s-switch-lbl   click settings.webSearchSwitch@20,10
rest           wait 1200
s3f            focus
s3v            ax settings.webSearchSwitch AXValue
s-esc          esc
rest           wait 1500
s4             ax settings.webSearchSwitch AXRole
s4f            focus
s-esc2         esc
rest           wait 1500
s5             ax settings.webSearchSwitch AXRole
s5r            ax settingsRow.Web* AXRole
# Out of the form (session 6): the field again, then a real click on a List row in the content → editing ends there.
s-list         click toolbar.view.List
rest           wait 2000
s-field2       click placeholder:BSA...
rest           wait 1200
s6f            focus
s-out          click listRow-9E9F2000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016
rest           wait 1500
s7f            focus
